# SPA fallback. The console is client-routed (BrowserRouter), so every path
# below has to be served index.html and let src/routes.tsx match it — without
# this, a refresh on /tickets or a pasted deep link returns Netlify's own 404
# and our NotFoundPage is unreachable.
#
# 200, not 301: the address must stay put so the router can read it.
/*    /index.html    200
